{
    "word": "кубарем",
    "lang_code": "ru",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [],
        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "810dbd1e-0dc8-30c3-8d1b-5f368cae85ee",
                "word": "кубарем",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7c259d2e-f48b-335c-8acd-f3b86879a043",
                        "entry_id": "810dbd1e-0dc8-30c3-8d1b-5f368cae85ee",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. переворачиваясь через голову; кувырком (о стремительном падении или движении вниз)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a86ff8b-2c0b-46a4-90ed-bcce36f1dd2c",
                                "sense_id": "7c259d2e-f48b-335c-8acd-f3b86879a043",
                                "text": "Он [майский жук] сослепу налетел на Незнайку и ударил его по затылку. Незнайка кубарем покатился на землю. Жук в ту же минуту улетел и скрылся вдали."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c3ea90d8-f491-3a2a-adab-c01c76549203",
                        "entry_id": "810dbd1e-0dc8-30c3-8d1b-5f368cae85ee",
                        "glosses": [
                            "очень быстро, стремглав, стремительно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e614c459-dd9e-49ff-be56-cd1d65b8a4f1",
                                "sense_id": "c3ea90d8-f491-3a2a-adab-c01c76549203",
                                "text": "Казачок Перфишка кубарем, в одной рубашке, вылетел из чулана, в котором спал."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7235ba2f-7e1a-398e-98d8-11835810ded9",
                        "entry_id": "810dbd1e-0dc8-30c3-8d1b-5f368cae85ee",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. употребляется как несогласованное определение"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c33c04a5-d14e-41e2-8915-a7f1fb5521cc",
                        "source_entry_id": "810dbd1e-0dc8-30c3-8d1b-5f368cae85ee",
                        "target_lang_word": "head over heels",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "head over heels",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "838bad03-1484-3374-a845-170a8545bcda",
                                        "entry_id": "f1655f82-4117-3483-b54f-7f48b72639e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tumbling upside down; somersaulting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d1810d7-e12e-4929-8853-300ccef96492",
                                                "sense_id": "838bad03-1484-3374-a845-170a8545bcda",
                                                "text": "She tripped and rolled head over heels down the hill."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4d7d682-321a-4f7d-99e8-9ff3fdb1f03f",
                                                "sense_id": "838bad03-1484-3374-a845-170a8545bcda",
                                                "text": "I was knocked head over heels about 20' from where I was before."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55ea831e-b4dc-3f46-b325-8fd6fb95bfeb",
                                        "entry_id": "f1655f82-4117-3483-b54f-7f48b72639e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "At top speed; frantically."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e721623c-3197-4de0-820f-5ed2db78d410",
                                                "sense_id": "55ea831e-b4dc-3f46-b325-8fd6fb95bfeb",
                                                "text": "Hearing the noise in the dark, the children ran head over heels back home."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2bdebe8-eb05-42ff-ae36-4d9621f618bb",
                                                "sense_id": "55ea831e-b4dc-3f46-b325-8fd6fb95bfeb",
                                                "text": "It told its readers that people all over the country were \"rushing head over heels toward the El Dorado on the Pacific— that wonderful California, which sets the public mind almost on the highway to insanity.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3414328-1010-3c8f-aa29-fb3388f75f34",
                                        "entry_id": "f1655f82-4117-3483-b54f-7f48b72639e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hopelessly; madly; to distraction; deeply; utterly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa36ecbb-cd97-4485-9619-a3194257b0a4",
                                                "sense_id": "b3414328-1010-3c8f-aa29-fb3388f75f34",
                                                "text": "She told me that her mom and Joey's dad aren't just in love, they are head-over-heels in love."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5c6e6a4-3f86-406c-b742-28d4f102e1c4",
                                                "sense_id": "b3414328-1010-3c8f-aa29-fb3388f75f34",
                                                "text": "I mean, do I just fall head over heels for the last girl I've kissed?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23f9b697-4945-49d3-a74b-80b3f95611da",
                                                "sense_id": "b3414328-1010-3c8f-aa29-fb3388f75f34",
                                                "text": "For research we went to Africa, and found ourselves head over heels into ritual (chapter 4)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "047122f8-53cf-4ca2-ac93-9901e5de77dc",
                                                "sense_id": "b3414328-1010-3c8f-aa29-fb3388f75f34",
                                                "text": "I am head over heels in trouble."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d724608-35e3-43cc-8119-f17d5b21c986",
                                                "sense_id": "b3414328-1010-3c8f-aa29-fb3388f75f34",
                                                "text": "Some of them lose and wind up head over heels in debt. Some of them win and wind up head over heels in debt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52a9f858-ef83-484e-bf5e-a524a08c58f4",
                                                "sense_id": "b3414328-1010-3c8f-aa29-fb3388f75f34",
                                                "text": "There over, hereunder / You got me head over heels / There's nothing left to fear / If you really feel the way I feel"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "head over heels",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe95e449-f194-39d8-85ec-823a1d530328",
                                        "entry_id": "2eb25d4c-07dd-30f8-b5b8-07a51e526b05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hopelessly smitten; madly in love."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4243b501-5c00-4d8e-83d4-08accd01f29c",
                                                "sense_id": "fe95e449-f194-39d8-85ec-823a1d530328",
                                                "text": "Something happens and I'm head over heels / Ah, don't take my heart, don't break my heart / Don't, don't, don't throw it away"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a3a7fee-3e4b-4159-bcbe-7574865a8b0a",
                                                "sense_id": "fe95e449-f194-39d8-85ec-823a1d530328",
                                                "text": "Steve is the hottest, smartest, funniest, and most athletic boy in all of Edison High. Who knew a jock could be captain of the math team? He is also the guy that every girl is head over heels for."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c43340e-c18b-48ca-9564-0430b2692e55",
                                                "sense_id": "fe95e449-f194-39d8-85ec-823a1d530328",
                                                "text": "Not to mention the young man that I was head over heels with was the jock at the school he attended. He played football and was damned good at it!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fca95a6d-ec02-4f88-93b4-e1aa9236f44e",
                                                "sense_id": "fe95e449-f194-39d8-85ec-823a1d530328",
                                                "text": "From what it appeared to most everyone on the set, including Presley right down to the lowly stagehands, Ireland was head over heels with the impish young actress Weld from the start."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48069fc9-683d-47eb-adc3-84d6d6150b8d",
                                                "sense_id": "fe95e449-f194-39d8-85ec-823a1d530328",
                                                "text": "Obviously at my age my interest was purely paternal but my younger self was head over heels."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6ba35549-f3f7-4bf6-a364-d8311878c902",
                        "source_entry_id": "810dbd1e-0dc8-30c3-8d1b-5f368cae85ee",
                        "target_lang_word": "rodando",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rodando",
